---
title: "saleLifecycle (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_prefund: initialize()
    q_prefund --> q_allocation: block.timestamp >= prefundEndTime
    q_allocation --> q_active: block.timestamp >= startTime
    q_active --> q_refund: block.timestamp >= endTime
    q_refund --> q_results: block.timestamp >= refundEndTime
    q_results --> q_supply: publishSaleResults()
    q_supply --> q_distribution: supplyTokens()
    q_distribution --> [*]: all investors claimed

    q_prefund --> q_canceled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_active --> q_canceled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_refund --> q_canceled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_canceled --> [*]: all investors refunded via withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()

    note right of q_prefund
        INV-001: Prefund stage: 1h-12w, early investors pledge capital
        INV-002: Allocation period: 1h-2w, backend processes allocations
    end note

    note right of q_active
        INV-003: Active sale: 1h-12w, signature-verified investments
        INV-004: Refund period: 1h-2w, regulatory compliance refunds
    end note

    note right of q_results
        INV-005: Results published via Merkle trees
        INV-006: Cancel blocked after results publication
        INV-007: Token supply enables distribution via clone vesting
    end note
